<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trident Micro started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trident Micro started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Carlos Valeiras said he started coverage of Trident Microsystems Inc as outperform and a 12-month price target of $25.</p>
<p>-- He set share earnings estimates of $1.36 for fiscal 1997 ended June and $1.80 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 1/8 to 18-7/8.</p>
</text>
